-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-45160c1 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default row-top\" data-eae-slider=\"80552\" data-id=\"45160c1\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-b579d77\" data-eae-slider=\"89353\" data-id=\"b579d77\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a7f5f0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6a7f5f0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\"><div dir=\"auto\">Honored to Shine Bright at <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\"><a class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x1ejq31n x18oe1m7 x1sy0etr xstzfhl x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xkrqix3 x1sur9pj x1fey0fg x1s688f\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/PhilippineAirlinesGlobal?__cft__[0]=AZa_1MRk8Lr2BC7-EUafmBLVAaWDJIBLvMpNFT3YWObrUkA66tl3PGyKXZ_xHj6pEnol66lQeWg0GX00t90_8pGz-YAvgIkEW5BmevBc95uZIM1iKac3QiVSRjvOlcZlOJlKtsQ1zC293aVzV2nR216qetg6aIi3atmMReJEd1vrzg&amp;__tn__=-]K-R\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"xt0psk2\"><span class=\"xjp7ctv\">Philippine Airlines<\/span><\/span><\/a><\/span>&#8216; Mabuhay Night &#8211; Appreciation Dinner Celebration! <span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/tb4\/1\/16\/1f38a.png\" alt=\"\ud83c\udf8a\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/tb6\/1\/16\/2708.png\" alt=\"\u2708\ufe0f\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"><div dir=\"auto\">Waytransit Travels & Tourism had the incredible privilege of attending Philippine Airlines&#8217; Mabuhay Night, an enchanting celebration of partnership and success. As one of the top performers of 2023, it was an absolute honor to be recognized amidst such esteemed company and to be in the presence of the Philippines Ambassador.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"><div dir=\"auto\">The evening was a vibrant tapestry of <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\"><a class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x1ejq31n x18oe1m7 x1sy0etr xstzfhl x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xkrqix3 x1sur9pj x1fey0fg x1s688f\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/hashtag\/filipino?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZa_1MRk8Lr2BC7-EUafmBLVAaWDJIBLvMpNFT3YWObrUkA66tl3PGyKXZ_xHj6pEnol66lQeWg0GX00t90_8pGz-YAvgIkEW5BmevBc95uZIM1iKac3QiVSRjvOlcZlOJlKtsQ1zC293aVzV2nR216qetg6aIi3atmMReJEd1vrzg&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#Filipino<\/a><\/span> culture, filled with laughter, music, and the warmth of camaraderie. Clad in our most colorful attire as per the festive Filipino tradition, we joined hands with other industry leaders to celebrate the achievements and milestones we&#8217;ve collectively reached.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"><div dir=\"auto\">At Waytransit Travels & Tourism, we&#8217;ve always believed in the power of collaboration and the strength of enduring partnerships. Our journey with Philippine Airlines has been nothing short of extraordinary, marked by shared values, mutual respect, and a relentless pursuit of excellence.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"><div dir=\"auto\">As we reflect on the past year&#8217;s successes and challenges, we&#8217;re reminded of the unwavering support and trust bestowed upon us by Philippine Airlines. It&#8217;s this unwavering support that propels us forward, driving us to innovate, excel, and exceed expectations at every turn.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"><div dir=\"auto\">To Philippine Airlines, we extend our deepest gratitude for the privilege of being part of such a remarkable evening. Your appreciation fuels our passion and inspires us to reach even greater heights together. Here&#8217;s to many more years of fruitful collaboration, shared victories, and unforgettable moments. Mabuhay!<\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0bf9447\" data-eae-slider=\"97343\" data-id=\"0bf9447\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<d